BT /F1 10 Tf 50 654 Td (1. American Bollworm \(Helicoverpa armigera\): Causes severe damage to bolls and squares.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 636 Td (   Management: Install pheromone traps \(5 traps per hectare\) and spray Bacillus thuringiensis \(Bt\).) Tj ET
