BT /F1 10 Tf 50 600 Td (   Management: Spray neem oil \(5 ml per liter\) or apply imidacloprid in severe infestations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 582 Td (3. Pink Bollworm: Bores into flower buds and mature bolls.) Tj ET
